      <description><![CDATA[<p>Ning Yao looked back again. She took Ning Tang’s spiritual form out of her Qiankun bag and stared at it in her hands, lost in thought. Before leaving the Western Swamps, she had used her spiritual energy to help Ning Tang’s roots and leaves grow. But after a few days, they started to wilt again.&hellip;</p>]]></description>
